  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Adding a Cr2O3 overlayer to CrN-coated Zr-4 will improve resistance to high-temperature oxidation.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr2O3 overlayer will reduce the oxidation rate by 30% relative to CrN-coated Zr-4.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is a 2–3 μm Cr2O3 layer deposited on CrN-coated Zr-4 by reactive sputtering at 300°C.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predicted improvement applies during exposure to steam at 1200°C for 100 hours.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will form a dense and stable Cr2O3 layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr2O3 layer will act as a barrier to oxygen diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduced oxygen diffusion through the Cr2O3 layer will lower oxidation of the underlying Zr-4 alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of oxidation-rate reduction may depend on adhesion between Cr2O3 and CrN.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of oxidation-rate reduction may depend on whether a dense and stable Cr2O3 layer forms.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The appropriate baseline is CrN-coated Zr-4 without the Cr2O3 overlayer.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis can be tested by exposing Cr2O3/CrN-coated Zr-4 and baseline CrN-coated Zr-4 to steam at 1200°C for 100 hours and measuring oxidation rate and Cr2O3 microstructure.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An oxidation-rate reduction below 20% relative to the CrN-coated Zr-4 baseline will falsify the hypothesis.",
